    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I thought you were my supervisor for a second there. Phew!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я подумав, що ти мій керівник на секунду. Фух!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>That slimeball Nicolas wanted to have his wife killed!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Цей слизький Ніколас хотів, щоб вбили його дружину!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Why are you even here?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Навіщо ти тут?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Hearing what Evelyn did to those men turns my stomach. Sick!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Те, що Евелін зробила з тими людьми, викликає в мене огиду. Мерзенно!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I need some rest. I feel like I need to punch someone.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мені потрібен відпочинок. Мені здається, що мені потрібно когось вдарити.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>It's very difficult to work in these conditions.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">В таких умовах дуже важко працювати.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I'm gonna need some water.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мені потрібна вода.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Nicolas... Another one bites the dust...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ніколас... Ще один помер...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Did you hear? Faceless lifted the blockade in Core City.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви чули? Безликі зняли блокаду в Центральному місті.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
